    "detailed_description": "The Wizard is The Fantasy Adventure. He helps him to find the Mistery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym. <br><br>Can you find The Wizard on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination?<br>Rush throught the Space before the Time runs out.<br><br>This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Wizard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For fans of 2D Open World and Metroidvanias.<br></li><li>Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to acess secret Areas.<br></li><li>Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear.<br></li><li>Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find.<br></li><li>Short game, about 2 hours.<br></li><li>Not an Action Combat, but Puzzle Exploration focused.<br></li><li>Amazing graphics and sound.<br></li></ul><br>The Wizard is a 2D Open World Sandbox game inspired on the very good Metroidvania genre titles. <br><br>Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.<br><br>The Wizard is a modern Maze Runner Adventure. <br><br>Can you find The Wizard before your Time runs out?",
